      "date": "2026-04-26T13:07:18.000Z",
      "title": "JSFB: Governance Meetings And Stable Assumptions Will Support Balanced Future Outlook",
      "body": "Analysts have kept the price target for Jana Small Finance Bank steady at ₹490, citing only minor tweaks to the discount rate and forward P/E assumptions rather than any major shift in the core earnings outlook. What's in the News Board meeting scheduled on Apr 29, 2026 at 15:00 Indian Standard Time to consider and approve audited financial results for the quarter and year ended Mar 31, 2026, along with other business matters (Key Developments).",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
